Hi,

I recently acquired an ES45 and tried to install Etch using the latest
beta 3 images but unfortunately the installer does not seem to work.

The machine has four 1GHz CPUs and 12 gigabytes of RAM and should
be ok hardware-wise, firmware is the latest available (7.2)

I can only get it as far as aboot loading the kernel + initrd and
then it just hangs.

Here's the output I got through serial console with businesscard
CD and netboot image.

businesscard:

